EVENT agent.message_chunk ses_vocab agent says hello with tabs collapsed
EVENT agent.thought_chunk ses_vocab thinking through it
EVENT user.message_chunk ses_vocab user asks a question
EVENT tool.call ses_vocab shell:go test [pending]
EVENT tool.call_update ses_vocab shell:go test [completed]
EVENT permission.request ses_vocab Allow shell command?
EVENT session.plan ses_vocab Implement watch
EVENT session.end ses_vocab stop_reason=end_turn
